    "each list is sorted ascending"
  ],
  "hints": [
    "Solve Merge Two Sorted Lists first; this problem is built on it.",
    "Folding one list at a time into an accumulator is O(kN) and is a legitimate answer.",
    "Better: merge in pairs, halving the number of lists each round, for O(N log k). A PriorityQueue over the k current heads also works."
  ],
  "complexity": "O(N log k) time",
  "signature": "ListNode? Solve(ListNode?[] lists)",
  "comparison": "Exact",
